The other forced laborer prostrated himself on his knees. "Give me time," he pleaded. "I will pay you back."
But the first servant refused. Instead, he went and had the man thrown into prison. He would be held there until he repaid his debt.
The other servants saw what was happening. They were deeply affected. They went and told their master everything that had happened.
